      "source_heading": "Experience",
      "source_text": "Experience",
      "heading": null,
      "content": [
        {
          "source_pages": [],
          "source_heading": null,
          "source_text": null,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "ETH Zurich, Zurich, CH\nStudent Research Assistant at Data Analytics Lab, Summer 2019\n\n– Interpretability in adversarial word embeddings for text\n\n– Adapted the codebase for adversarial attacks on embeddings, conducted qualitative and quantitative analyses, worked on adversarial text generation via embedding projection",
          "table": null
        },
        {
          "source_pages": [],
          "source_heading": null,
          "source_text": null,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Imperial College London, London, UK\nResearch Intern at Intelligent Behaviour Understanding Group (iBUG), Summer 2017\n\n– A novel audiovisual dataset for normal, whispered and silent speech\n\n– Created tools for data collection and analysis, analysed the collected data, implemented fixes, worked on the reimplementation of the existing network in a different library",
          "table": null
        },
        {
          "source_pages": [],
          "source_heading": null,
          "source_text": null,
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "École Polytechnique Fédérale de Lausanne, Lausanne, CH\nResearch Intern at Data Intensive Applications and Systems Laboratory (DIAS), Summer 2016\n\n– Microarchitectural analysis of OLAP database systems\n\n– Examined the changes in microarchitectural utilization of different column-oriented database systems on distinct workloads",
          "table": null
        }
      ],
      "subsections": []
    },
